WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:07.583
Pagewise. A knowledge base you can trust: built by you, with help from AI, and used by any AI.

2
00:00:08.383 --> 00:00:15.383
It starts with your own library. Search inside every page, and open any passage right where it is.

3
00:00:16.183 --> 00:00:24.517
As you read, write your notes beside the passages that matter: in words, math, a sketch, a photo, or your own voice.

4
00:00:25.317 --> 00:00:33.317
Then explain each idea in your own words. Every sentence cites a note, and every note leads back to its page.

5
00:00:34.117 --> 00:00:39.783
The map shows how your ideas connect, and where your understanding is still thin.

6
00:00:40.583 --> 00:00:48.917
AI can recommend: it points you to a passage worth reading, with a question. But it never writes your notes. You do.

7
00:00:49.717 --> 00:00:59.050
And because every statement is traced to its page, your knowledge becomes a service for any AI: served from your Mac, cited to the page.

8
00:00:59.850 --> 00:01:04.183
Your knowledge base goes with you, on your phone, privately.

9
00:01:04.983 --> 00:01:09.317
Pagewise. Your knowledge, traced to the page. Free for Mac.
